# name: window/WindowAggregationWatermark.test
# description: A watermark that allows a lateness: WATERMARK(ts, 10 sec) after a tumbling event-time window keeps the window [0, 10 s) open while the largest event time read is under 20 s, so a record at 3 s arriving after 2000 records at 12 s still counts in it
